    "title": "Dan and Bobby Hurley's family built basketball legacy",
    "text": "ASUHurley family has tight bond on and off the court and the same passion for basketball Michelle GardnerJune 18, 2023Updated April 3, 2024, 5:28 p.m. MTEditor's note: This story, which originally published on Father's Day 2023, has been updated to reflect Dan Hurley bringing his Connecticut Huskies basketball team to Arizona this week for the Final Four.The only game Bobby Hurley played against younger brother Dan was gut-wrenching for all. Bobby was a junior at Duke and Dan was a freshman at Seton Hall. The fact that it was a 1992 NCAA Tournament Sweet 16 game made the situation all the more precarious. The Blue Devils prevailed in that showdown in Philadelphia and went on to win the national championship, but Bobby scored only four points and had more turnovers than assists.",
